.TH NEO-CONTACTS 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-contacts \- contacts app for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-contacts
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Contacts app rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: the
contact list, a contact's details, the editor and the contact picker. It is
D-Bus activatable as de.yesman.Contacts.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-dialer(1), neo-messaging(1)
